WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.290
- Welcome back everybody.

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.960
It's the part of the
show where I present you

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.840
with something delightful
from the internet.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.162
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:06.162 --> 00:00:09.480
(jaunty music, crowd
cheering and clapping)

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.490
Visitors in Telluride, Colorado

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.620
are having an amazing day

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.640
because it's an awesome place,

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.473
just to start with that.

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:16.100
But they were stunned when a bear

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.140
dashed through a resort
chased by a police officer.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.810
The incident was caught on video,

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.630
but one woman, she's my personal hero,

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.620
was the only one to ask the
really important question.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.453
Take a look.

00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:30.540
(crowd of onlookers
gasping and chattering)

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.692
- [Male Onlooker] Holy shit.

00:00:31.692 --> 00:00:32.720
- [Grace] Oh my God.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.553
- [Male Onlooker] Don't
tase it, don't tase it.

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:34.386
- [Grace] Is that Jeff?

00:00:34.386 --> 00:00:35.861
The hot cop?

00:00:35.861 --> 00:00:39.010
(audience laughs and claps)

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.680
- Is that, wait, there's
like a deadly animal.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.360
She's like, wait, is
that Jeff, the hot cop?

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.590
Go chase him. (laughs)

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:48.760
And did you catch it, it is amazing.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.290
Oh my God, let's play it one more time.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.203
I just love it.

00:00:52.804 --> 00:00:53.730
(group of onlookers gasps and chatters)

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.967
- [Male Onlooker] Holy shit.

00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:55.800
- [Grace] Oh my God.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.633
- [Male Onlooker] Don't
tase it, don't tase it.

00:00:56.633 --> 00:00:57.466
- [Grace] Is that Jeff?

00:00:57.466 --> 00:00:58.574
The hot cop?

00:00:58.574 --> 00:01:01.965
- (laughing) It's my favorite

00:01:01.965 --> 00:01:04.130
What I'm Liking we've ever done.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:04.963
The hot cop.

00:01:04.963 --> 00:01:06.630
I want to have drinks with her.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.790
This girl, she knew her priorities.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.660
She knew what was important.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:11.830
Her name is Grace.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:12.750
She's awesome.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.160
And we have her on the line right now

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.910
watching on Denver 7 at 2pm.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.150
So first and foremost, I love you.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:22.930
And no one was hurt, right?

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.380
- Hi Kelly, I love you too.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.820
Fortunately, no one was injured.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.720
Jeff did not end up tasing the bear,

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.310
So that's good news
for everyone, hey guys.

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:34.361
Especially the guy that
was screaming behind me.

00:01:34.361 --> 00:01:38.600
- (laughing) I mean, I play that so often.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.903
It's like is that Jeff, the hot cop?

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.560
So what's up with Jeff.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.873
Any chance with Jeff?

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.460
- I did post a few
follow ups on my Tik Tok,

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.830
sharing the news that he's married.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:52.663
- [Kelly] Oh, okay.

00:01:52.663 --> 00:01:53.760
- But even though he's off the market,

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.705
I'm still hoping to
find someone to cuff me.

00:01:56.705 --> 00:01:59.315
- [Kelly] (laughing and clapping)

00:01:59.315 --> 00:02:03.440
Did she say, did you say cuff me?

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:06.080
Oh my God, you have got to come in studio

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:10.163
for an interview, I love you so much.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.100
Jeff is taken, we're looking
for the other Jeff though.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.220
He's out there, I believe it.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.490
I really want you to
come on my show in person

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.740
just to hang out and have some wine

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.140
or whatever you want to drink.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.830
Thank you so much, Grace.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:23.410
You are so awesome.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.430
And one of a kind and
I love where you live.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.263
It's beautiful.

00:02:26.263 --> 00:02:28.450
Telluride is one of the
most beautiful places.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.500
All right, I'm liking
your posts right now.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.450
- [Grace] Any time.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.240
(audience applauds)

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.890
Well, that's not all Grace,

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.787
our season-long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:36.787 --> 00:02:38.430
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:39.920
thinks your video is hilarious.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.200
I don't know, I doubt they
think it's funny as I do.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.150
So they'll be using their
G2 gel ink pen to write

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.710
you a check for a thousand dollars.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:47.619
How's that sound?

00:02:47.619 --> 00:02:49.847
(audience claps and cheers)

00:02:49.847 --> 00:02:51.800
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.910
It's not Jeff, the hot cop,

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.560
but it'll buy you some fun stuff.

